insights.chartPrompt:
Chart: {{title}}
Scope: {{scope}}
Meaning: {{description}}
{{note}}

Data:
{{data}}

Respond in Markdown, using at most 350 words and exactly these section headings:
## Main findings
## Evidence in the data
## Points to watch
## Recommended actions

Format of each section:
- In "Evidence in the data", a Markdown table with columns: Indicator | Result | Interpretation (2 to 5 rows, without invented indicators).
- In "Points to watch", a short list.
- In "Recommended actions", a Markdown table with columns: Priority | Action | How to monitor (up to 4 actions).

