insights.comparisonChartPrompt:
Analyse a direct comparison chart between two selections of the same type.
Chart: {{title}}
What it shows: {{description}}
Selection A: {{scopeA}}
Selection B: {{scopeB}}

Data of selection A:
{{dataA}}

Data of selection B:
{{dataB}}

Answer in Markdown, in at most 350 words, using exactly these section headings:
## What the chart shows
## Main differences
## What to do
## Caveats

In "Main differences", use a Markdown table with the columns: Item | Selection A | Selection B | Difference. In "What to do", list 2 to 4 practical actions for the professor or the coordination. Use only the numbers in the data; do not invent values.
